{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne night, I opened my father\u2019s old diary\u2026 and found the truth he left behind.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the Cove</strong> is a 2D action adventure RPG where mystery and exploration intertwine. Your father disappeared in a dying coastal town, leaving only scattered diary pages and unanswered questions. Now you must retrace his steps through forgotten dungeons, battle the strange creatures that drove everyone away, and uncover what really happened in The Cove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.poster.avif?t=1770109016\" width=720 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.webm?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.mp4?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Follow Your Father's Trail</strong><br>Each diary page reveals new locations, memories, and clues. Your father's words guide you through The Cove's mysteries, but can you trust everything he wrote?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Real-Time Combat with Depth</strong><br>Fight corrupted creatures using weapons, tools, and environmental tactics. Every encounter rewards observation and strategy, not just quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f A Town Worth Saving</strong><br>Meet the last residents of The Cove, each haunted by their own past. Help rebuild homes, solve personal quests, and forge bonds that change how your story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Exploration That Rewards Curiosity</strong><br>Discover hidden dungeons, solve environmental puzzles, and unlock shortcuts. The world is handcrafted with secrets in every corner, from the abandoned lighthouse to the crypt beneath the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a Choices That Echo</strong><br>Your actions ripple through The Cove. Which residents you help, which secrets you uncover, and how you confront your father's legacy all shape your journey's end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 A Coastal Fantasy Brought to Life</strong><br>Explore stormy shores, sun-drenched ruins, and eerie depths in a pixel art world inspired by classic adventure games but with a modern, atmospheric twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.poster.avif?t=1770109016\" width=720 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.webm?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.mp4?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through storms, ruins and fading echoes of the past in a coastal fantasy adventure inspired by <i>classic Zelda exploration</i> and <i>Stardew Valley style town life</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.poster.avif?t=1770109016\" width=720 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.webm?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.mp4?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.avif?t=1770109016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras_big/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.webp?t=1770109016 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you find your father\u2026 or become another echo lost to The Cove?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8f7ee5217e814c103aa198eae34713cf.avif?t=1770109016\" alt=\"the_cemetery\" width=1277 height=714 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094850?t=1770109016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094850?t=1770109016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/2cd8222b7ec22b9f4b6af4a9da65a3b9abb57127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770109016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/2cd8222b7ec22b9f4b6af4a9da65a3b9