trong>\u2694\ufe0f Real-Time Combat with Depth</strong><br>Fight corrupted creatures using weapons, tools, and environmental tactics. Every encounter rewards observation and strategy, not just quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f A Town Worth Saving</strong><br>Meet the last residents of The Cove, each haunted by their own past. Help rebuild homes, solve personal quests, and forge bonds that change how your story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Exploration That Rewards Curiosity</strong><br>Discover hidden dungeons, solve environmental puzzles, and unlock shortcuts. The world is handcrafted with secrets in every corner, from the abandoned lighthouse to the crypt beneath the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a Choices That Echo</strong><br>Your actions ripple through The Cove. Which residents you help, which secrets you uncover, and how you confront your father's legacy all shape your journey's end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 A Coastal Fantasy Brought to Life</strong><br>Explore stormy shores, sun-drenched ruins, and eerie depths in a pixel art world inspired by classic adventure games but with a modern, atmospheric twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.poster.avif?t=1770109016\" width=720 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.webm?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.mp4?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through storms, ruins and fading echoes of the past in a coastal fantasy adventure inspired by <i>classic Zelda exploration</i> and <i>Stardew Valley style town life</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.poster.avif?t=1770109016\" width=720 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.webm?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8d66a88c552751456f09834aad489287.mp4?t=1770109016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.avif?t=1770109016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras_big/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.webp?t=1770109016 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you find your father\u2026 or become another echo lost to The Cove?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8f7ee5217e814c103aa198eae34713cf.avif?t=1770109016\" alt=\"the_cemetery\" width=1277 height=714 /></span></p>","developers":["TideTeller"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id